  "script": "Google just turned group planning into an AI workspace. It’s called Tabletop. A Google Labs experiment. One shared space. One AI agent. You ask @tabletop to build the tool. Need an itinerary? Done. Dinner poll? Done. Expense splitter? Tournament bracket? Done. Everyone edits together in real time. Like a Google Doc, but the doc builds itself. Right now it’s limited. U.S. users, 18 plus, waitlist only. But the signal is bigger. AI isn’t just answering questions. It’s building the apps you need on the spot.",
